The “three flavour” categorisation presented here is provided with brevity in mind and inevitably neglects a wealth of nuances, insights, generalisations, and historical contexts to GNN models. Importantly, it excludes higherdimensional GNN based on the Weisfeiler-Lehman hierarchy and spectral GNNs relying on the explicit computation of the graph Fourier transform.
